Converting the Python code to C++ requires handling similar tasks with C++ features. Below is a concise implementation that replicates the core functionality while adhering to C++ best practices. Note that C++ lacks built-in JSON/CSV parsing and NLP libraries, so we use minimal external dependencies (e.g., nlohmann/json for JSON) and simplify NLP.

